
This was Percy's FIRST door for Metro, so the historical value is
incredible, and, well, the gameplay IS okay, but a bit on the <yawn>
side....

Just set this up like any old other door, making sure all the hang#?
files are in the door directory - it grabs them and sends them to the
modem as required.  No instructions required, really!

